    series:
      - type: line
        encode: {x: step, y: eval_loss}
        name: eval_loss
        smooth: false
        width: 2
        lineColor: "$pine"
        marker: {shape: circle, size: 3, fill: "$pine"}
    xAxis:
      title: "step（eval_steps = save_steps = 100）"
      label: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted"}
      gridLine: false
    yAxis:
      min: 1.50
      max: 1.68
      title: "eval_loss"
      label: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted", numberFormat: "0.00"}
      gridLine: {style: dash, color: "$hair", width: 0.75}
    legend: false
  - elementId: best-mark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [300, 128, 320, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      wrap: false
      text: "▲ best = 1.5266 @ step 2700（约 1.95 epoch）"
  - elementId: facts-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 110, 260, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$pine"
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      wrap: false
      text: 训练事实（adapter_info.json）
  - elementId: facts
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 136, 256, 196]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>· 完整 4 epochs / <strong>5,548 步</strong>，未早停</p>
        <p>· 耗时 <strong>23.02 小时</strong>（≈15s/步）</p>
        <p>· 峰值显存 <strong>69.72 GB</strong> / 121GB</p>
        <p>· final train_loss <strong>0.604</strong></p>
        <p>· 终点 eval_loss <strong>1.626</strong>，best <strong>1.5266</strong></p>
        <p>· loss 冒烟 <strong>PASSED</strong></p>
        <p>· completion_only_loss = true</p>
  - elementId: read
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [648, 340, 256, 130]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleT"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: read-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 350, 232, 112]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: |
        <p><strong><span style="color:$terra">曲线读法</span></strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px">step 2800 起 eval_loss 持续回升 → 过拟合；若按末步发货会损失 0.10。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px">BestCheckpointCallback 的价值正在于此：发货的是 <strong>best/（step 2700）</strong>，不是末步。</p>
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 502, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: footer-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 510, 640, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      wrap: false
      text: 来源：adapter_info.json training.eval_trajectory / best_checkpoint.promotion_history
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [864, 510, 40, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: "07"
